00:08:47.266 --> 00:08:49.466
Cryptéro !

153
00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.000
Croâporal !

154
00:08:53.066 --> 00:08:54.066
Pikachu !

155
00:08:54.133 --> 00:08:57.500
Flambusard !

